  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "Player jukebox - the placeable one, for inns, taverns and the Well of Eru. Anyone may use it; the separate jb_jukebox ITEM is the admin-only one from the Castle Homeless chest. Playback is area-wide and dies at reboot by design (area locals, see jb_inc.nss). Roadmap: player-accessible-juke-box."
